{"route":"/docs/4.1/extend/icons/","version":"4.1","renderedVersion":"4.1","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Icons","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Guidance and suggestions for using external icon libraries with Bootstrap."},"blocks":[{"id":"content--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Bootstrap doesn’t include an icon library by default, but we have a handful of recommendations for you to choose from. While most icon sets include multiple file formats, we prefer SVG implementations for their improved accessibility and vector support."},{"id":"preferred","type":"heading","en":"Preferred","level":2},{"id":"preferred--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"We’ve tested and used these icon sets ourselves."},{"id":"preferred--list-1","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"preferred--item-1","type":"item","en":"<a href=\"https://fontawesome.com/\">Font Awesome</a>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"preferred--item-2","type":"item","en":"<a href=\"https://useiconic.com/open/\">Iconic</a>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"preferred--item-3","type":"item","en":"<a href=\"https://octicons.github.com/\">Octicons</a>"}]}]},{"id":"more-options","type":"heading","en":"More options","level":2},{"id":"more-options--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"While we haven’t tried these out, they do look promising and provide multiple formats—including SVG."},{"id":"more-options--list-1","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"more-options--item-1","type":"item","en":"<a href=\"https://github.com/danklammer/bytesize-icons\">Bytesize</a>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"more-options--item-2","type":"item","en":"<a href=\"https://material.io/icons/\">Google Material icons</a>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"more-options--item-3","type":"item","en":"<a href=\"https://ionicons.com/\">Ionicons</a>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"more-options--item-4","type":"item","en":"<a href=\"https://feathericons.com/\"